                "source": "TweetDeck Web App",
                "text": "Today, the House voted on the bipartisan Give Kids a Chance Act, introduced by @RepMcCaul and @RepGusBilirakis. This legislation provides a much-needed spotlight on pediatric cancer research by expanding access to medicines and treatment options for children battling rare diseases.\n\nI\u2019m proud to have supported this bill and to stand alongside families in #OH5 and across the country as we work toward improving outcomes for patients and closing the gap in pediatric drug research.",
